{
    "name": "存储",
    "category": "tfg:logistics",
    "icon": "tfc:wood/chest/douglas_fir",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)物品存储$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#chests)箱子$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#crates)板条箱$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#vaults)物品保险库$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_chests)超级箱$()$(li)$(bold)物品与流体存储$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#ae2)ME 存储$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#kegs)大酒桶$()$(li)$(bold)流体存储$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#barrels)大桶$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#drums)储液桶$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#fluid_tanks)储液罐$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#multiblock_tanks)多方块储罐$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_tanks)超级储罐$()",
            "title": "目录",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "简介",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "text": "在 $(tfg) 中，你会积累海量的物品、材料和流体。搭建庞大的存储系统来整理这一切非常重要。存储最关键的要素是其$(thing)容量$()和$(thing)限制$()。关于随身物品管理，请阅读$(l:logistics/personal_storage)个人存储$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "箱子",
            "anchor": "chests",
            "item": "tag:forge:chests",
            "text": "箱子可以存放 18 组物品，大箱子为 36 组。箱子可以容纳最大为$(l:game_mechanics/size_and_weight)大型$()的物品。$(br)如果箱子里放有$(thing)食物类物品$()，就会招来啮齿动物。所以最好把食物存放在$(item)小缸$()里。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：箱子拥有全部木材变种！",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "Y"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "Y": "#forge:chests/wooden[facing=north,type=single]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "板条箱",
            "anchor": "crates",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:crates",
            "text": "在存储方面，GregTech 提供了$(item)板条箱$()，可以容纳所有尺寸的物品，等级越高容量越大，从 27 格到 144 格不等。$(br)板条箱支持$(thing)物品过滤器$()、$(thing)腐烂物销毁覆盖板$()等物流覆盖板。$(br)你甚至可以用$(item)胶带$()封装箱子，拆掉时保留其内容物，方便你大量运输物品。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：木质板条箱相当便宜，很适合存放原木。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:crates"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "物品保险库",
            "anchor": "vaults",
            "item": "create:item_vault,create_connected:item_silo",
            "text": "机械动力的$(item)物品保险库$()是整合大量物品的绝佳方式，也可以给$(thing)运动中的装置$()增加存储。$(br)多个保险库可以拼成大型 3D 结构，每个保险库扩展 20 格存储空间。你无法手动放入或取出保险库中的物品，需要使用漏斗之类的物品物流设备。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：$(item)集装箱$()是保险库的多彩替代品。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "       ",
                            "       ",
                            "       "
                        ],
                        [
                            "       ",
                            "       ",
