        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "多方块储罐",
            "anchor": "multiblock_tanks",
            "item": "gtceu:wooden_multiblock_tank,gtceu:bronze_multiblock_tank,gtceu:steel_multiblock_tank",
            "text": "$(item)多方块储罐$()是专门用于存储大量流体的结构。每种类型最多可以有两个阀门，容量随等级提升。$(li)$(bold)木制储罐$()：容量 1,000,000 mB$(li)$(bold)青铜储罐$()：容量 4,000,000 mB$(li)$(bold)钢制储罐$()：容量 8,000,000 mB"
        },
